     "uuid": "246a6651",
     "text": "Experimentum Crucis"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "typ": "textblock",
   "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "uuid": "7b7f35bc",
   "y0": 72,
   "h": 119.83,
   "sheet": 0,
   "ind": 0,
   "split": [],
   "cc": [
    {
     "typ": "text",
     "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
     "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
     "uuid": "05e8bf3c",
     "text": "Methought: perchance the glass itself doth stain the light, as wine staineth a tablecloth. So I set a second Prisme to catch the red alone. Behold — red it remain'd, and red only, howsoever I turn'd the glass. Likewise the blue stay'd obstinately blue.",
     "cc": [
      {
       "typ": "markup",
       "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "uuid": "6ea6c8bd",
       "start": 43,
       "end": 48,
       "style": 1
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "typ": "textblock",
   "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "uuid": "40de400b",
   "y0": 191.82999999999998,
   "h": 50.332,
   "sheet": 0,
   "ind": 0,
   "split": [],
   "cc": [
    {
     "typ": "text",
     "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
     "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
     "uuid": "f16ed3a4",
     "text": "Then with a lens I gather'd the whole streak together again, and it was white once more!",
     "cc": [
      {
       "typ": "markup",
       "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "uuid": "74cfe037",
       "start": 72,
       "end": 77,
       "style": 9
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "typ": "textblock",
   "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "uuid": "c45607a6",
   "y0": 242.16199999999998,
   "h": 96.664,
   "sheet": 0,
   "ind": 0,
   "split": [],
   "cc": [
    {
     "typ": "text",
     "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
     "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
     "uuid": "6c64dc2d",
     "text": "Conclusion: White light is no simple thing, but a most curious heap of all the colours, mixt. The glass doth not make colours; it doth but sort them, as a careful shepherd sorteth sheep.",
     "cc": [
      {
       "typ": "markup",
       "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "uuid": "88337db1",
       "start": 0,
       "end": 11,
       "style": 2
      },
      {
       "typ": "markup",
       "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
       "uuid": "72bf22ea",
       "start": 113,
       "end": 117,
       "style": 1
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "typ": "textblock",
   "cre": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "mod": "1666-02-03T11:00:00.000",
   "uuid": "5ed76dd2",
   "y0": 338.82599999999996,
   "h": 50.332,
   "sheet": 0,
   "ind": 0,
   "split": [],
   "cc": [
